  "description": "A .NET client for the ICE Mortgage Technology Encompass Developer Connect API: OAuth2 endpoints (password grant, token exchange, introspection, revocation), a cached API token, per-user calls through token exchange, internal user lookup, loans (entities and field reader), the loan pipeline (filters, paging, counts), compliance (Mavent) reports, standard loan conditions (read only), a loan's eFolder documents (removed ones too) and attachments with file and page-image downloads (read only), a concurrency gate that stays under the Encompass limit with 429 retries, correlation ids on errors, and IHttpClientFactory integration. API areas are added one at a time.",
